T(v).$\n\n| $T(v)=\\,\\,$ |  | {{field-1}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-2}} |  |  |" "Consider the matrix $T$ and the vector $v$ given below. \n\n$$\nT=\\begin{bmatrix}-4 & 3 \\\\ 2 & 5\\end{bmatrix},\\,v=\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nIf $\\,T\\,$ is the standard matrix of the linear transformation $\\,T,$ find $\\,T(v).$\n\n| $T(v)=\\,\\,$ |  | {{field-1}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-2}} |  |  |"] [:db/cas 17592186299560 :question/worked-solution "Using the fact that $\\,T(v)=T\\cdot v\\,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}T(v) & =T\\cdot v \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-4 & 3 \\\\ 2 & 5\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-18 \\\\ -4\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" "Using the fact that $\\,T(v)=T\\cdot v\\,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}T(v) & =T\\cdot v \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-4 & 3 \\\\ 2 & 5\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-18 \\\\ -4\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/cas 17592186299561 :question/problem "Consider the matrix $T$ and the vector $v$ given below. \n\n$$\nT=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 7 \\\\ -3 & 4\\end{aligned}],\\,v=[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nIf $\\,T\\,$ is the standard matrix of the linear transformation $\\,T,$ find $\\,T(v).$\n\n| $T(v)=\\,\\,$ |  | {{field-1}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-2}} |  |  |" "Consider the matrix $T$ and the vector $v$ given below. \n\n$$\nT=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 7 \\\\ -3 & 4\\end{bmatrix},\\,v=\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nIf $\\,T\\,$ is the standard matrix of the linear transformation $\\,T,$ find $\\,T(v).$\n\n| $T(v)=\\,\\,$ |  | {{field-1}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-2}} |  |  |"] [:db/cas 17592186299561 :question/worked-solution "Using the fact that $\\,T(v)=T\\cdot v\\,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}T(v) & =T\\cdot v \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}0 & 7 \\\\ -3 & 4\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-7 \\\\ -19\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" "Using the fact that $\\,T(v)=T\\cdot v\\,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}T(v) & =T\\cdot v \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 7 \\\\ -3 & 4\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-7 \\\\ -19\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/cas 17592186299562 :question/problem "Consider the matrix $T$ and the vector $v$ given below. \n\n$$\nT=[\\begin{aligned}6 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2\\end{aligned}],\\,v=[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 8\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nIf $\\,T\\,$ is the standard matrix of the linear transformation $\\,T,$ find $\\,T(v).$\n\n| $T(v)=\\,\\,$ |  | {{field-1}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-2}} |  |  |" "Consider the matrix $T$ and the vector $v$ given below. \n\n$$\nT=\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2\\end{bmatrix},\\,v=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 8\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nIf $\\,T\\,$ is the standard matrix of the linear transformation $\\,T,$ find $\\,T(v).$\n\n| $T(v)=\\,\\,$ |  | {{field-1}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-2}} |  |  |"] [:db/cas 17592186299562 :question/worked-solution "Using the fact that $\\,T(v)=T\\cdot v\\,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}T(v) & =T\\cdot v \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}6 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 8\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-18 \\\\ -16\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" "Using the fact that $\\,T(v)=T\\cdot v\\,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}T(v) & =T\\cdot v \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 8\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-18 \\\\ -16\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/cas 17592186299563 :question/problem "Consider the matrix $T$ and the vector $v$ given below. \n\n$$\nT=[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 2 & 3 \\\\ 4 & 0 & -2 \\\\ 5 & 1 & 1\\end{aligned}],\\,v=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nIf $T$ is the standard matrix of th